{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1258,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c27a073fd77cbf3199ec839",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你想好想要的东西了吗？\r\n差不多该做出决定了，\r\n不然圣诞老人可能会伤脑筋喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec14c95506b74f3c530fa0da609c5a803f60c7cea6362735bff0526954d3a415",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f7d61c7cde1654fecfcf4b68",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "坐雪橇时要小心一点。\r\n只要一滑下坡就没人能止住。\r\n──简直就是所谓的彻底失控。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c4ee1e8fdc1631a21ed2f009b265457942698b33798d9b78f2b4ab4ac85f32b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3dd12f8b91989a4585cb0c28",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我有点担心头饰的部分。\r\n如果看起来快要掉了，\r\n希望你立刻告诉我……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ec628354be62f341671021628b87341b9af415d5fcd920bd62bcc7d258714ac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2cd53baa19d78771edf549d2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "指甲很鲜艳吧？都不觉得这是\r\n自己的手，会忍不住一直盯着看。\r\n感觉好新鲜喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "58b46d1fbc8464fe8c679e5a0a95d5e5f3a30fff119567742278448dd78d348c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20fb9ac0fa6155536a2c73eb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ヘアアレンジで、あんなに私の髪が\r\n少なく見えるとは…！フライト君の\r\nあの技、私にもできるだろうか…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2299e63491fe6acf43292805eaf9c78de8fd2dd90590c4ece8c98e6a6c1e4702",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "91216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f15e5e75c50d66ef162478df",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ユキノ君の宿題を手伝ったら、\r\n編み物の眼鏡ケースをくれたんだ。\r\n手作りとはな…大切にしよう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5ae30b0b2227495a5501beb9a1a7eb400a926c8b0ac5ba42b15d2d3383cd6da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "91217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6fd01e45ed4ba74c73d81efe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "クリスエス君が、海外にいる両親に\r\n日本酒を贈りたい、と。どの銘柄が\r\nいいか…ふふ、まずは父に相談だな",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b9376c78d22a76a6ad3d7abc3f117e4fe3ac87636940993970add51279dceac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "91218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2aeef2b166ac7fc2d86f2418",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "シャカール君と幾何学の難問に\r\n挑んだんだ。何度も試行錯誤したが\r\n…解けた瞬間、凄い達成感だった。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b15b1dd4f0805d62fdf1fa004b3103b422586dd764788ddb50d429da8faf4753",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "91219"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ceebbbce5db8e1ed64d4e41",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ギムレット君は同室のブライアンに\r\n手を焼いていないだろうか…\r\n『混沌こそ秩序』と笑っていたが…",
      "source_fingerprint": "162a355e41105b4e793d88a9ddc110a1f32372963eb8b388f49ce3d02be66629",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "91220"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1f299fe0604991a81d6c122",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "毎朝、トップロード君が皆に挨拶を\r\nするおかげで、私の教室は明るい。\r\n良好な関係を築く術…私も見習おう",
      "source_fingerprint": "a37eecefb3c5575c850bd740b68f5167b2ce066723eafe37184ffe1b5dc870d1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "91221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d17f4fe96debc43ff50f99a6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "昼休憩は機械工学の本を読むんだ。\r\n駆動制御はフォームの参考になる。\r\n私の方程式にも活かせるだろう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a3c1e2d8c79e26c84959621ee5bdcaf99715c7152f62acab79fd2e8052e9260",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "91222"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9c2ff3c5ead20f3e4aa4d33",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今夜、ライツ博士推薦のSF小説を\r\n読むとしよう。リアリティに満ちた\r\n近未来か…夜ふかしには注意だな。",
      "source_fingerprint": "43cdca3611d8c15c52551797abfeef5232a168387a67e38b919307ff9e3334de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "91223"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea147c91cf513db6083823ac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ふぁ…春の暖かさは眠気を誘うな。\r\nなぜこうも眠いのか…そうだ、\r\n睡眠アプリで眠りの質を見てみるか",
      "source_fingerprint": "707ef7b1cf3c34710e6cacd4ff42917acea71f38f5d5195cff07854aaa8ff052",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "91224"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b4a3361afb14e597d9a8c7f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "また夏限定のバナナスイーツか…！\r\nくっ、この季節は体重管理アプリが\r\n必須だな。気を引き締めなければ…",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6c0472eb4fdfcd955ace95d608ca186f7f105a92440dbf4be45ddba42481149",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "91225"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:192458f81126c2d35bde840a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "秋は古本祭りが楽しみだ。誰かの\r\n努力が滲んだ参考書を見ていると…\r\n自然と、背筋が正される。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea0b80848ca24458489b48c568c2547f6673d159c99ddc7627ef7d0a202537ed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "91226"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:974d3feb882c725d595453dd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "雪だるまなら任せてくれ。美しい\r\n球形であり、安定感も抜群だぞ。\r\n昔、ブライアンにも絶賛された程だ",
      "source_fingerprint": "814c004b3c0b2e969656af2bd969ce2a84c7f2dd85d7a6b2593b6ccf0ec851c4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "91227"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9297becea6284ddc0d69f282",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "どうかな、トレーナー君！\r\nいつもよりさらさらだろう？最新の\r\n電動ヘアブラシは凄いな…ふふっ♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "223fce94a2c69cf200a4812de4ba16025a35aa3b26fc4d44a44261dd51771fb2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "91228"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f26eb6e4adbfe69266b254c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "強度、重量、視力の矯正度数…\r\nこのバイザーに一切の妥協はない。\r\n体の一部も同然、だからね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5250a968e332d72eea9ea605989e6028663d668381fec6935e7bbb3ad5893bd2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "91229"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34a170480ba2c11b95cc03b3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "「具有逻辑并充满效率」……\r\n这是训练的理想状况。\r\n我们彼此加油吧，训练员君。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba430ace8a105b7f99852f4121f14a15f87aa0af8a7b2416416d4e773aeb5198",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:32a6cc726aa5274526fa24aa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いくぞっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1ae48257d0805dcd2123dc155ce6b9f73292e838d06ccd81047d6c2cbb246a8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee7e29b57a046c53d19ec272",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "反复进行很重要这个道理，\r\n不管运用在检讨理论或训练都一样。\r\n让我们绷紧神经好好努力吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "498110b21338639910eb05b41578c610168184d00932dd99a06a667951f8643b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:184dffaa82465191a179ddc9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "刚才我脑中浮现了一个假说。\r\n我可以套用在训练中加以验证吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b50422a9a02e41c6bec2b62891fb7f7241ec74922667a66031afd080b482a3d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:959af65835d9fa3de1f4c40e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员君，趁现在让我\r\n掌握指导方针吧。\r\n我会遵照你的方针进行准备。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3b3279e9e51e0197b4ce1efa6ec3a091095a6b4162b56ff2cbf52c5e0943375",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e9248c64ec34f6646704477",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和你讨论训练项目，\r\n逐渐变成了我每天的乐趣。\r\n呵呵，今天也要麻烦你了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d21d39fa1a5651a23bbeaa01589f1bb82b93e39364b30546f5e0930af9c07749",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bca3fdfa46870ec17556ea01",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "努力总有一天必定会开花结果──\r\n就跟训练员君一样，\r\n我也是如此深信着。",
      "source_fingerprint": "301af4e61c95e70d2cd192b72b95b3b6171da33492e66559a5949f538bad3c53",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e02a2f565861d0d36a6e17a8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "都是因为有你这个知音相助，\r\n我才能埋首训练。请你好好期待\r\n我以结果报答你的那天吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e06319ce1329b042cc7c41995992ecb08c90137ace122145766f6e0c2e763817",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42974ffc2d3b37dfe3ce038f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我想顺畅地进行练习。\r\n假如我讲话太拐弯抹角……\r\n还请你尽管出言指正。",
      "source_fingerprint": "40f60b7b722cdc2b3c8f42fffbbba98cfe5bf69c13782640d57e9b6905a369c4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00165266f7be685918d0a428",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了将祝福献给大家──\r\n来，开始吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "eea6e8afb5bab4762cb1a0aaad304a7fb64947651bf389f05084c6804f9b0a30",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04822a77683913fc6ff587e4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练时顺便进行\r\n发礼物的练习吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c71b5d4fd59f56e2ab450b51586c8cd5ce023e480b75639d94da1a2907a8dee6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8303aac04d9536b25ed1b77",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不用担心，没问题的。\r\n这套衣服做得比看起来\r\n更适合奔跑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b76ce2a25f93c3be84148b5980dbcb821943be40cbb24f21c011b0b3b79dff72",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e995ee6667186cfb65f58b3b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不管衣装如何，\r\n我都清楚自己该走的路。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ad45dee119129c4f7d32b483ec2aed1c612931571349de329320e1dbbf6ab9b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10d4b43d787ace40f86fba92",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果我的奔驰能够\r\n带给他人幸福──\r\n……唔，这样也挺不赖的呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a80dde64e23a16922d745731fcee89116b7d48b635ca0318b1dedd4caab41b57",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56e831443e6a71234643556c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我发誓一定会送给训练员\r\n你盼望的胜利当作礼物。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d84fdde1505f9da13b0fdb5f592d0f759371b6853613e13d1598584d9b0afc5f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ecde9012086e57d43feb3557",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就如同你为我祈祷的一样，\r\n我也祈祷你能\r\n获得幸福喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5699a6121524faea2915101e7e07571178ca15485c033f199f93a402beb38d7f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f5048ccc11d96b472258998",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "トレーニングの予測演算完了だ。\r\n私の理論が正しいか否か…\r\n結果で証明しよう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2df9de039032e0e69aa971fbf47899deb1c1f6efe579a0d409eb80766da7bc13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "92215"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:62fa5208c1b7d985977c2f17",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "パーツのメンテナンスなら完璧だ。\r\n負荷耐久試験もクリアしている。\r\nどんなメニューでもこなせるぞ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e24e9e12e2fc74289ce5e65cc291140f5c1533d2470460952953a0d0c667150d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "92216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b665b6a30c9e07a71a9d864b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "機械工学にトライアル＆エラーは\r\n付き物…トレーニングも同じ、\r\n間違っていたら再挑戦するだけさ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eccf5cd7a71f785d9c2259335bac0d0c0f1934e15ba0cdf868339b132cc69e77",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "92217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f7413d4117dd262fcd91ccb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "先ほど、このイヤホンで音楽を\r\n聴いたんだ。好きな曲は集中力を\r\n上げる効果がある…いい状態だよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd73f21973cb837728aeeb378f63df5214dc06317aa3c6c27383e909def2897a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "92218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10ca99ebaf330770d4e158ef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "君と検討を重ねたタスク…\r\n勝利に近づくため、\r\nしっかり果たしてみせよう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b5c23fc7aae5c632ac7927b4054622a80c3855050872bac14e65784793c2f8b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "92220"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0baa4051e749cd39f1d217dd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "意見があれば遠慮なく言ってくれ。\r\n組み立てた理論のわずかな誤差…\r\nなくすためには、君の力が必要だ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "69b3a4a31d50385ed0218789b6598c588a21e90fb234cd272ee06908507ecd15",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "92221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cabe7cf190f120ec98aabf83",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "誰にも負けない“勝利の方程式”…\r\nきっと、君とだからこそ\r\n辿り着けるんだ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "401fae0ccf29ba798b42f6b1da4c840e74a2d77b823af4c2aa7445c1d9769bfb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "92222"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e91d6b0052776ca295ec271f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和你谈论的一切……都是我的养分。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d8aa9ef9ce59560c99bf801a8b8a2356ea2283d8dfdc2f4fe59fb0d4144f7ab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94918835e52431c53b5231cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我看见向前迈进的路线了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8fb8d47da21715d096f5d2e3d3e2d92ec38ff18fb74d669c0acdc10c8706f9c6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa9aad0db9d8e9a8a049a019",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是段温暖又幸福的日子！",
      "source_fingerprint": "abc2d549ae8871b1361a28b7826b80b03369aa45fe8853c0ce9b5a9650007b9f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5cfe89caa50860d3bb95b57f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我有带给你幸福吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1add6934120d3fff1ec917166a9090a09dd49e73c48bd3a1638615ed468a22c3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aea80217a6623231c398732e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "君と掴んだ栄光…\r\nメモリに刻んだよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9f8ce955f2ae59f8b39f5ddf33fc062ab8b505a3051b7f4a49c77ff85cb5837",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "93204"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f5a851b78311cbdd30edc98b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "目標コンプリート。\r\nこれからも進化してみせる。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c16c36aef0e0722da411aed2286850ccbf25ded51a292492f1618034878bef6f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "93205"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f0b6212cd0230cfe31c37b8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好，我们迈向下一个目标吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b67ab8693567f84fb4fd8269f0d865fd60b465230ce8002de1f2ca8dcabb4682",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58578068554d3cb08e3b8d1d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "获得回报了啊……呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a879cf9dbcb8a91253a67bab44429e163a02226462939ff767fab87133ded6b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab4dc355ba04fc1db293bd05",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是琵琶晨光。请多指教。",
      "source_fingerprint": "832ff66d6a4436d0d01f6ee1baef6ce3deb2e324eb8b34219100c2608736a946",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0d64e114c07adaf887c83a25",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我必定会实现──\r\n专属于我的胜利形式！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2edf3d7fb7e3d5e741dede851ea41e8a5c5104f6e2e65f56109496b3ea53ab2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3fe107f54472df930493a0e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "期待我有更好的表现吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "91a485f7cc85c091add45cd3351edc1aff0eb0ffeefc228a8e82a2a89bc09051",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:050e7182bd397a36909e34f1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我来教你最合适的训练法吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "54fbf929efe194f7612612fd9fc10edcdcc64caa5ff29841ab5214f1d1519035",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:247c40e198ea584c37f772ee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赐予你神圣的祝福吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "25025845a7b3df4b8b4f6707ce1a47952bb86fa9229813252b7a44f682209a5d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff878593f024135f7b27eef2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像能带来更多的幸福。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2ee7bb33fd93b5ee554668e18daee273a31786949e8e574c8867c98d89e98ff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ad319e3625c8d17d3b5aae0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "开始庆祝圣诞夜的宴会吧！\r\n祝大家幸福──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b4d9cc150a2ff2b72c355faad690b88d7da43091237a7d21ae6158a2345cba1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81de6967b700247cd2ede4a8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是琵琶晨光。\r\n一起让神圣的宴会开始吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "359285d072053f1a8ef421f8e266fa89690afbd74b7d940e4331262e11466cb0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:623e8d2abbc857ec6872167b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "機能向上を確認。\r\n研究の成果、だな。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9558d7f51c58b0cf9e7d050bd7c45126f651791a597a33752bc8ab6fe7bff564",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "95207"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95585524594ed37ef7dd3bbf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "パフォーマンス上昇…\r\nアップグレード完了だ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e16d738806107a41ea9062689a1235814702c26056cbbb8578e4d66b88cbe491",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "95208"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:faa4eaf364a4c6dc8265279a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "アナライズ、完了。\r\n勝利への最適解…お見せしよう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7296009eb688747f7ae2b82e79923a53eb6e56c3a6a82f96e059e1896f2e6b74",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "95209"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e8bc4c07d28f603b5541579",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ビワハヤヒデ、起動。\r\n勝利への演算を開始しよう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b96294c41a4d679b8ab0b524b239dfa9d7d851448bf4a2cfaf5d1661c4bca8d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "95210"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0e07e31f774ceebc0598b4c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会赢的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2f14e9ede388c81be7c62616915591806c6ea995183f0b5fd0fe715098c7722",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1414118e4e52e5121570ed3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要是和训练员一起，\r\n做什么好像都会很有趣呢！\r\n我还是第一次有这种感觉！",
      "source_fingerprint": "89da969a158128f7616f1e5e3bf1d280b25cbf927d3254ef035387e318c51756",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:119e836254954eb3fcbb6052",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我出发了☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "d87c73674448030810201b02536701821e85b098250d29146354877d722be62e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:553534ed80dd325b6acc1f94",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我回来了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "6751dfe306ea79492d45848f61a94cb9c4ec83cec4d271d8b9dfd75cb5796c29",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ab21e56fc0736e3d40d0ed1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Maya，绝对会成为\r\n闪闪发光的成熟马娘！所以，\r\n要在最近的地方看着Maya哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "20db4e0c5381ac5dab47e210ffdc5aa88ce9beee17dcf4220a807f585d7d4853",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b972f8325eecf27a27dd978e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Maya搞懂了哦！\r\n做任何事都是有意义的！\r\n诶嘿嘿，我好像又更接近大人了呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "618e681bb67534d52842c6ec5594ef583977d7c5f4fb17185abe4e9c70b32081",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34a499b154cc29d8f3f5f902",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新年快乐☆\r\n那个，我们一起去新年参拜吧！\r\n甜酒的话，Maya也可以喝吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a714b83e444ca9b64ae90985f7020abe1d5990ec146a83b1420e0ae3c0a3182",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9569b4e5989e4bf830c04f5a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "给你！这是Maya为你准备的巧克力☆\r\n因为训练员是大人了嘛，\r\n所以我选了最苦的口味哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9b330e234dbb959cbaa9bc9ee68c4311d746ca71cf94eef4d63019caa8ef4c2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3005c03f0de8089b6d5cbc95",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员的话……\r\n啾☆Maya的飞吻也送你当礼物吧！\r\n诶嘿嘿，情人节快乐哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "49488637c4fdac90d8c192023a3f0dad94ba95105067df25fbeefaac2dc8eb58",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb3326671d9d7e5b1cb3a673",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "七夕的故事好浪漫哦……\r\n天上的星星也好漂亮，\r\n是感觉有点大人的夜晚呢☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "d72c7fd1824f04958b746c89f6ae40d2510de453509c93a8f896e3150a593159",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d19718e5ad58888e2cc7ae2b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不给糖就捣蛋☆\r\n大人会做的恶作剧……是什么啊？\r\n亲额头之类的……？呀哇哇……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "38bc112a204a1b16a34b9d8d49ea8fa775b0e3dafd71dbb4dd5c56b952e1b37b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31c9b73d0b079f734b8874e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "圣诞快乐☆\r\n用烤鸡、蛋糕跟胡萝卜\r\n来办一个有点成熟感的圣诞派对吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8150703a0134ed72346c7382a53397ed463153bca5e963fe103849a46aa073c5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d4b8985119c0164ed06952a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我不光是期待蛋糕跟圣诞树……\r\n还很期待你为我准备的礼物哦……\r\n我会满心欢喜地等着的……♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f663000310c6e9f3e6d767283a339e6dc739f0f0f6bb61363b721c1234136a9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b6e90acc7675ca5f39ad475",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "各个击破～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "64870093fb3e447e67bb3a35b7cc40328b079f4332c5a0d3c1b232c345d92d79",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:709de7eadf7f277f1391bc08",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要大扫除，还要吃荞麦面！\r\n还有很多我想看的东西！\r\n新年期间有很多开心的事要忙呢～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0d3791b798ae1ebd37071c174d91bcf23d0ad7579d4256c42d1d971a5970745",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce488d24ecfc9d8e33df43bb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "祝你生日快乐哦──☆\r\n我们先去买蛋糕吧！\r\n然后找大家来庆祝一整天！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a57bc694716cdef27afb415a2f67b098c48dcb916d7b790af5e9e51b2b723b5a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e1be467e4510366c92ffc0b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日快乐──☆\r\n礼物的话……啊！徽章你觉得如何？\r\n我们一起去挑吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "655956f6708ccd39af53c36e71f253e917cec86f3e834c0dfac8d41154133f76",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd7bff8036ef99ae3ba97b74",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "距离成为成熟的女人，\r\nMaya又更近了一步……！\r\n就照这步调飞～快地变成大人──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ebb88e24e9007001e7cd63ca2447c5795b3010a2fe5abed3435f2feea5dc100a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f1fe24878c01781be076f56e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那个那个，训练员……？\r\nMaya想要大人的生日礼物啊……\r\n飞、飞吻之类的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0bfc3a56e811a49a3c6423d44a74a016aafb54e597ad41709ddc9092b999ee8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "10014"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
